sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Next.js frontend
    participant A as Express API
    participant M as MongoDB

    U->>F: enter email and password
    F->>A: POST /api/auth/login
    A->>M: find user by email
    A->>A: compare password hash
    alt unknown email or wrong password
        A-->>F: 401 same message for both
    else correct, 2FA is off
        A->>M: create Session
        A-->>F: 200 user, HttpOnly session cookie
    else correct, 2FA is on
        A->>M: store a one-time pending id on the user
        A-->>F: 200 mfaRequired, short-lived pending cookie (no session yet)
        F-->>U: ask for the authenticator code
        U->>F: enter the 6-digit code or a recovery code
        F->>A: POST /api/auth/mfa/verify
        A->>A: check the pending cookie is valid and unused
        A->>M: check the code matches the current 30 s step and was not used before
        alt code wrong
            A-->>F: 401 bad_code
        else pending step expired
            A-->>F: 401 mfa_expired, start again
        else code accepted
            A->>M: create Session with mfa = true
            A-->>F: 200 user, session cookie, pending cookie cleared
        end
    end

    Note over U,A: Google sign-in joins the same 2FA step after Google confirms the identity (UC-11)

    rect rgb(252, 244, 240)
    Note over F,A: Admin routes (UC-12)
    F->>A: any /api/admin/... request
    A->>A: requireAuth, role admin, session has mfa
    alt session has no 2FA
        A-->>F: 403 mfa_required
    else
        A-->>F: the response
    end
    end
